 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2025-10-10",
   "text": "No Budget, No Pay Act\nThis bill prohibits Members of Congress from being paid in a fiscal year until both chambers approve the budget resolution and pass all regular appropriations bills for that fiscal year. Retroactive pay is prohibited for such a period.\nThis bill takes effect on September 29, 2027."
  }
